            "title": "Why install the defenses you attack",
            "body": "Two reasons to run guardrails in your lab. First, to **practice bypassing them** — a jailbreak that beats a real guardrail is a far stronger finding than one against a naked model. Second, because you'll eventually **recommend and deploy** them. **Analogy:** a locksmith studies the very locks they'll both pick and install. Install defenses now so your attacks are realistic and your advice later is grounded.",
