        "description": "Powerful tooling is only legal and ethical inside clear rules of engagement. This topic translates real bug-bounty and pentest safe-harbor practice into habits for AI testing: test only what you're allowed to, keep harmful output contained, cap your own costs, and document everything for responsible disclosure. These rules are what separate a researcher from a liability.",
