        "description": "It is tempting to treat an LLM's output as safe, finished text. But the moment that output is rendered in a browser, run in a shell, put in a SQL query, or used as a URL or file path, it becomes code that something downstream executes. OWASP LLM05 (Improper Output Handling) is about that failure — and the fix is to treat model output as untrusted user input, everywhere.",
