        "description": "Membership inference (OWASP ML04) answers one dangerous question: was this specific record in the model's training set? If an attacker can tell that *your* medical record helped train a hospital's model, that alone is a privacy breach, because it reveals you were a patient. It is a direct, legally significant leak rooted in models quietly memorizing the examples they were trained on.",
