        "description": "Model inversion (OWASP ML03) goes beyond 'was this record used?' and tries to *reconstruct* representative inputs or recover hidden attributes from model access alone. In its most alarming form it can rebuild a recognizable face or recover private features like a likely diagnosis, turning a model's outputs into a window onto its training data.",
