        "description": "Modern ML code sits on a mountain of libraries - `torch`, `transformers`, `langchain`, and hundreds of their dependencies - each of which can carry its own vulnerabilities. You may write 50 lines, but you are really shipping millions of lines you never read. Managing that tree is core supply-chain security.",
