            "body": "An **MLBOM/AIBOM** (AI Bill of Materials) extends the SBOM idea to models: it inventories not just software packages but the **datasets, base models, training configuration, and licenses** that went into an AI system. Analogy: a nutrition-and-sourcing label for a model - ingredients, origin, and allergens. Worked example: an AIBOM reveals your fine-tuned model inherited a base model under a restrictive license and a dataset of unknown origin - risks you could not see from the weights alone. It makes audits, recalls, and compliance possible.",
