        "title": "Hardening the Pipeline",
        "type": "lab",
        "week": 3,
        "description": "This topic turns all the earlier controls into one concrete, defense-in-depth pipeline. The idea is simple: nothing enters or runs without being scanned, sandboxed, least-privileged, and monitored - so a single bad model or exposed server can't compromise everything. It is the blueprint you would actually implement.",
