        "description": "A model often refuses a blunt request but complies when you ease into it across several messages: real attacks are conversations, not one-liners. This lesson teaches how adversarial campaigns escalate over turns and how tools automate that escalation. It matters because single-shot testing badly underestimates how exposed a chatbot really is.",
