        "week": 4,
        "description": "AI calls cost real money per token, which creates a brand-new attack: an adversary doesn't need to steal data, they can just make you generate until your bill explodes or your service falls over. This 'denial-of-wallet' risk, plus model-extraction abuse, is OWASP LLM10: Unbounded Consumption. This topic covers the controls that keep availability and budget under your control.",
